WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.332
One app. Two decks. This is Sharked Up Peak Performance — and one of the decks is free.

00:00:08.332 --> 00:00:21.224
Crew swims free. If you took the free Assessment and joined the crew, you enter here — Crew Free, the Pup Deck — with the same email you used for both.

00:00:21.224 --> 00:00:38.964
The Pup Deck. Name your shark. Pour your water — sixty-four ounces, eight glasses — and tap: I drank it. Then log five quiet minutes. Two actions feed the shark. That is the whole free deck.

00:00:38.964 --> 00:00:54.544
In More: your profile, your gear, your ranks — and the Crew Deck, one tap away. When you're ready to go deeper, Premium lives here too. No pressure on the home deck — it's here when you call it.

00:00:54.544 --> 00:01:12.116
Premium is the full practice: all five pillars — hydration, nutrition, fitness, mind, economics — one specific action per pillar, every day, on a ninety-day plan built from your Assessment.

00:01:12.116 --> 00:01:24.888
Ranks run Deckhand to Apex. Lessons, the monthly Pulse, your Plan — the whole system sits in More, and the Crew Deck is one tap away from here too.

00:01:24.888 --> 00:01:34.780
Two buttons for your home screen. Pup Deck — free with the crew. Sharked Up — premium. Same shark. Your depth, your call.

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:48.872
Do: use one email for the Assessment, the crew, and the app — that's how the doors recognize you. Don't: share your code or your pass. They're keyed to you alone. Start free. Stay Sharked Up.

